(2209426, 304108, 43191, '<td valign="top">This makes me so sad. This is not only many people''s opinion of " The after life " or should I say lack of it, but also what they live every day. I truely hope ( actualy I believe I know ) that you are wrong. For everyone who feels they are living in a pit of darkness and have nothing more to look forward to in this life or after it, I feel a deep compasion. I pray you will one day discovery a much more wonderful truth. <br/>I give you a 10 for evoking such emotion in me even if it dosn''t match your feelings. Good luck.</td>', 'This makes me so sad. This is not only many people''s opinion of " The after life " or should I say lack of it, but also what they live every day. I truely hope ( actualy I believe I know ) that you are wrong. For everyone who feels they are living in a pit of darkness and have nothing more to look forward to in this life or after it, I feel a deep compasion. I pray you will one day discovery a much more wonderful truth. I give you a 10 for evoking such emotion in me even if it dosn''t match your feelings. Good luck.', '2006-03-08 00:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
