(2214697, 303525, 30049, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  If the surrounding pieces of this image were in focus it would work (in otherwords - motion on the body, nowhere else).  Did you use a tripod?  My guess is this is a hand-held shot.  Exposure on the leaves is hot and the sky in the background is blown-out.  If it was possible a higher angle would have helped to isolate the subject and the headstones, eliminating the sky bg.  4 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Neat idea.  If the surrounding pieces of this image were in focus it would work (in otherwords - motion on the body, nowhere else).  Did you use a tripod?  My guess is this is a hand-held shot.  Exposure on the leaves is hot and the sky in the background is blown-out.  If it was possible a higher angle would have helped to isolate the subject and the headstones, eliminating the sky bg.  4 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-09 14:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
