(2221260, 303384, 52731, '<td valign="top">This seems a little boring, maybe a little more saturation to bring out the colours would help. I do like how it almost looks like a painting though.</td>', 'This seems a little boring, maybe a little more saturation to bring out the colours would help. I do like how it almost looks like a painting though.', '2006-03-12 09:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221261, 303983, 52731, '<td valign="top">I like this idea but it''s really grainy and those grey spots on his face are very distracting.</td>', 'I like this idea but it''s really grainy and those grey spots on his face are very distracting.', '2006-03-12 09:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
