(2225457, 304165, 53572, '<td valign="top">nice, but is the cross even necessary?  it''s a stronger image without it, and i reall don''t think it adds to the meaning of the pic.</td>', 'nice, but is the cross even necessary?  it''s a stronger image without it, and i reall don''t think it adds to the meaning of the pic.', '2006-03-13 19:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
