(2225471, 303884, 53572, '<td valign="top">quite nice.  i find the cross a bit much - it doesn''t really add to the image, clutters up the frame, and isn''t needed for the message.</td>', 'quite nice.  i find the cross a bit much - it doesn''t really add to the image, clutters up the frame, and isn''t needed for the message.', '2006-03-13 19:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
