(2225925, 304149, 42495, '<td valign="top">Really creepy.  How did you do it?</td>', 'Really creepy.  How did you do it?', '2006-03-13 22:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225930, 303981, 42495, '<td valign="top">The fact that she''s turned away from the tombstone really adds to the effect, even if it may be done so we can read the tombstone.  It''s as if she can''t handle what happened, or perhaps she doesn''t want her mother (or whoever) to "see" her cry.  The tears look real.</td>', 'The fact that she''s turned away from the tombstone really adds to the effect, even if it may be done so we can read the tombstone.  It''s as if she can''t handle what happened, or perhaps she doesn''t want her mother (or whoever) to "see" her cry.  The tears look real.', '2006-03-13 22:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225936, 302731, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and how the colors of the paper stand out, but the girl is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea and how the colors of the paper stand out, but the girl is a bit distracting.', '2006-03-13 22:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225944, 302962, 42495, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me wonder what happened...   The person walking by adds to the effect because our loss does not belong to everyone.</td>', 'This picture makes me wonder what happened...   The person walking by adds to the effect because our loss does not belong to everyone.', '2006-03-13 22:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225954, 302457, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the light.  Is that a real peson?</td>', 'Nice effect with the light.  Is that a real peson?', '2006-03-13 22:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225958, 304177, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but would have been better without the smiley.</td>', 'I like the idea, but would have been better without the smiley.', '2006-03-13 23:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225961, 303444, 42495, '<td valign="top">Stained glass is nice, but a lot of things to draw the eye.</td>', 'Stained glass is nice, but a lot of things to draw the eye.', '2006-03-13 23:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225968, 303215, 42495, '<td valign="top">The tears are a bit distracting.  The don''t look real and it takes away from the photo.  Besides that, it really makes me think.</td>', 'The tears are a bit distracting.  The don''t look real and it takes away from the photo.  Besides that, it really makes me think.', '2006-03-13 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225985, 304132, 41411, '<td valign="top">kinda...</td>', 'kinda...', '2006-03-13 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225992, 303320, 11793, '<td valign="top">i like it - high marks !<br/> <br/>good luck.</td>', 'i like it - high marks ! good luck.', '2006-03-13 23:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225995, 304172, 11793, '<td valign="top">chaos - nice abstract.<br/>good luck.</td>', 'chaos - nice abstract.good luck.', '2006-03-13 23:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2225999, 302697, 11793, '<td valign="top">nice lighting.<br/>good luck!</td>', 'nice lighting.good luck!', '2006-03-13 23:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226022, 304132, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little creepy, but cool.  Nice shot.</td>', 'A little creepy, but cool.  Nice shot.', '2006-03-13 23:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226023, 303739, 30049, '<td valign="top">This feels like it just jumps right out at you.  Very neat effect.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This feels like it just jumps right out at you.  Very neat effect.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-13 23:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226024, 303026, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think this is very interesting.  Love the play on shadows to get the effect you did.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this is very interesting.  Love the play on shadows to get the effect you did.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-13 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226025, 303320, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Really like the way you put this together.  The glow around the tube is a nice touch.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great composition.  Really like the way you put this together.  The glow around the tube is a nice touch.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-13 23:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226028, 303384, 30049, '<td valign="top">Normally, this kind of shot makes a good background.  It''s right on for this challenge however.  You must have been pretty excited to see this cloud formation come together!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Normally, this kind of shot makes a good background.  It''s right on for this challenge however.  You must have been pretty excited to see this cloud formation come together!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-13 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226030, 304043, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little on the morbid side, but creative.  I like the dirt on the hand and the bright green of a new plant.  Very symbolic and well thought out.  Nice job.</td>', 'A little on the morbid side, but creative.  I like the dirt on the hand and the bright green of a new plant.  Very symbolic and well thought out.  Nice job.', '2006-03-13 23:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226032, 304059, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep...made me look!  ;^)  Great sign for this.  Fits the challenge quite well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep...made me look!  ;^)  Great sign for this.  Fits the challenge quite well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-13 23:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226034, 302836, 54229, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this isn''t going to be a very difficult delivery.</td>', 'I''m guessing this isn''t going to be a very difficult delivery.', '2006-03-13 23:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226038, 303938, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the connection to the challenge, but it''s all fuzzy for this one anyway.  ;^)  Not sure what I''m looking at here, but it''s an interesting image.  Nice job on the composition and using your space wisely.  7 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure I get the connection to the challenge, but it''s all fuzzy for this one anyway.  ;^)  Not sure what I''m looking at here, but it''s an interesting image.  Nice job on the composition and using your space wisely.  7 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-14 00:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226042, 304000, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  That''s a bit spooky.  Would be a great moonlight catch.  Fits the challenge very well, and I like the angle you''ve taken on capturing this image.  Almost could have gone even shallower on the DOF.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok.  That''s a bit spooky.  Would be a great moonlight catch.  Fits the challenge very well, and I like the angle you''ve taken on capturing this image.  Almost could have gone even shallower on the DOF.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-14 00:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226045, 303444, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely light from the stained glass.  Good eye to see it and be there at the right time.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely light from the stained glass.  Good eye to see it and be there at the right time.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-14 00:03:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2226046, 304194, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool, snow in March somewhere.  ;^)  Hope you''re enjoying the IR filter.</td>', 'Cool, snow in March somewhere.  ;^)  Hope you''re enjoying the IR filter.', '2006-03-14 00:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226053, 303512, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice pretty picture.  ;^)  Need to be a little more careful on the cropping (left side) - but I''m sure you''ve heard that more times than you care to.  ;^)</td>', 'Nice pretty picture.  ;^)  Need to be a little more careful on the cropping (left side) - but I''m sure you''ve heard that more times than you care to.  ;^)', '2006-03-14 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226055, 303776, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Colorful.  Way too small.  Not getting the connection to the challenge with this theme.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice image.  Colorful.  Way too small.  Not getting the connection to the challenge with this theme.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-14 00:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226057, 304203, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute sign and a good idea.  Unfortunately the photo is way too small.  Need to use the max dimension of 640 on one side as much as you can to show detail.  This image appears to be over-exposed a little.  There are some tutorials I believe on the website on how to resize an image for challenges.<br/> <br/>Good luck - come back and give it another go!  ;^)</td>', 'Cute sign and a good idea.  Unfortunately the photo is way too small.  Need to use the max dimension of 640 on one side as much as you can to show detail.  This image appears to be over-exposed a little.  There are some tutorials I believe on the website on how to resize an image for challenges. Good luck - come back and give it another go!  ;^)', '2006-03-14 00:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226063, 302675, 30049, '<td valign="top">Have to work to see this image.  A bit dark.  The theme choice of Ash Wednesday and the Resurrection works well for this challenge.</td>', 'Have to work to see this image.  A bit dark.  The theme choice of Ash Wednesday and the Resurrection works well for this challenge.', '2006-03-14 00:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226082, 304124, 24528, '<td valign="top">Need my shades...Give us warning</td>', 'Need my shades...Give us warning', '2006-03-14 00:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226093, 304003, 24528, '<td valign="top">Congrat on nice picture..But little over kill with long title.</td>', 'Congrat on nice picture..But little over kill with long title.', '2006-03-14 00:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226110, 302845, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Not sure what to make of this one.  I can kind of get an abstract sense of light flowing upward into the heavens?  Abstract is tricky.  I personally don''t do it very often, if at all, and certainly not for challenge entries.  ;^)<br/> <br/>From a technical standpoint the colors and composition could work.  What really knocks this down is the noise.  If this was cleaner/crisper...???<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Not sure what to make of this one.  I can kind of get an abstract sense of light flowing upward into the heavens?  Abstract is tricky.  I personally don''t do it very often, if at all, and certainly not for challenge entries.  ;^) From a technical standpoint the colors and composition could work.  What really knocks this down is the noise.  If this was cleaner/crisper...??? Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-03-14 00:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226114, 304108, 33672, '<td valign="top">Hah!</td>', 'Hah!', '2006-03-14 00:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226119, 304059, 46290, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo and unique interpretation! I love that the up arrow is not straight up, gives it a sense of depth.</td>', 'Excellent photo and unique interpretation! I love that the up arrow is not straight up, gives it a sense of depth.', '2006-03-14 00:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226122, 303215, 46290, '<td valign="top">I love the unique interpretation, the close crop just pulls you right into the picture.</td>', 'I love the unique interpretation, the close crop just pulls you right into the picture.', '2006-03-14 00:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226124, 304002, 46290, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what the reflection is, made me wonder which part i was supposed to be trying to look at.</td>', 'Can''t really tell what the reflection is, made me wonder which part i was supposed to be trying to look at.', '2006-03-14 00:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226126, 303603, 46290, '<td valign="top">I loved this picture, just wish you could have softened the light a little bit to show some of the features on her face, would have made the glow look heavenly rather than just overdone.</td>', 'I loved this picture, just wish you could have softened the light a little bit to show some of the features on her face, would have made the glow look heavenly rather than just overdone.', '2006-03-14 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226158, 303374, 52034, '<td valign="top">Wow. A little chiched, but absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'Wow. A little chiched, but absolutely beautiful.', '2006-03-14 01:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226163, 302043, 52034, '<td valign="top">There''s a little of your background showing on the left side of the flower. Otherwise, the colours are stunning and I love the focus and composition. I jsut wish it fit the challenge better!</td>', 'There''s a little of your background showing on the left side of the flower. Otherwise, the colours are stunning and I love the focus and composition. I jsut wish it fit the challenge better!', '2006-03-14 01:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226165, 304062, 52034, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like the light coming down from the top corner. I just wish the background sheet was ironed!</td>', 'Nice idea. I like the light coming down from the top corner. I just wish the background sheet was ironed!', '2006-03-14 01:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226170, 302782, 52034, '<td valign="top">This would be pretty much perfect if not for the hydro lines in the background.</td>', 'This would be pretty much perfect if not for the hydro lines in the background.', '2006-03-14 01:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226178, 303978, 48549, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2006-03-14 01:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226179, 303460, 52034, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. It might look better with a bigger focal range though, getting the wings in too.</td>', 'This is lovely. It might look better with a bigger focal range though, getting the wings in too.', '2006-03-14 01:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226180, 304011, 52034, '<td valign="top">The colours are amazing. This seems like a sad afterlife.</td>', 'The colours are amazing. This seems like a sad afterlife.', '2006-03-14 01:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226183, 303014, 48549, '<td valign="top">Very crisp sharp photo.  Nice details</td>', 'Very crisp sharp photo.  Nice details', '2006-03-14 01:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2226185, 304247, 52034, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite so far, but I must say, that American Express card looks FAKE.</td>', 'This is my favourite so far, but I must say, that American Express card looks FAKE.', '2006-03-14 01:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
