(2227903, 304011, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scene and you''ve captured it in such wonderful light- that mist on the water is beautiful. I love the silhouette of the seated man though he''s rather too centred for the composition to be as strong as it might for me. I like the large area of negative space provided by the sky. Dark foreground is a bit messy... Great pic overall.</td>', 'What a beautiful scene and you''ve captured it in such wonderful light- that mist on the water is beautiful. I love the silhouette of the seated man though he''s rather too centred for the composition to be as strong as it might for me. I like the large area of negative space provided by the sky. Dark foreground is a bit messy... Great pic overall.', '2006-03-14 19:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2227905, 302457, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting truly is the be-all and end-all of photography and you''ve really used it to powerful effect here. How clever to convey so much mood just with lighting. Love it!</td>', 'Lighting truly is the be-all and end-all of photography and you''ve really used it to powerful effect here. How clever to convey so much mood just with lighting. Love it!', '2006-03-14 19:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
