(2229229, 302660, 37252, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, I gave you an 8 on this. Would have been higher had the color rafges been better. The back of the boots are so dark there is no detail left to them. The sepia tones are really good for this type shot, but try to even them out better.</td>', 'Clever idea, I gave you an 8 on this. Would have been higher had the color rafges been better. The back of the boots are so dark there is no detail left to them. The sepia tones are really good for this type shot, but try to even them out better.', '2006-03-15 03:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
