(2229377, 304150, 28742, '<td valign="top">A 6 from me if I voted on this one. It meets the challenge well enough - maybe too literal for some. photographically, the composition suffers as mentioned from those two foreground tombstones, but if you would have moved those out of the way, I would have said it is a stunningly crisp, if macabre, image. <br/> <br/>The title is ok, but how about this: "How deep does the rabbit hole go?" ;-) Hang tough - you''ve got skills.</td>', 'A 6 from me if I voted on this one. It meets the challenge well enough - maybe too literal for some. photographically, the composition suffers as mentioned from those two foreground tombstones, but if you would have moved those out of the way, I would have said it is a stunningly crisp, if macabre, image.  The title is ok, but how about this: "How deep does the rabbit hole go?" ;-) Hang tough - you''ve got skills.', '2006-03-15 05:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
