(2229506, 303111, 42495, '<td valign="top">This is a house''s hell because a house is made for people to live in; to be filled with life.  This house is abandoned and neglected and has a barbed wired fence all around keeping everyone out.<br/> <br/>I wanted to shoot some of the other buildings on the property that were literally falling down, but didn''t know about the barbed wire until I pulled into the driveway.  If I shot them from far, a newer metal building  was in the way.  If I shot the house from the other side, it was blocked by the trees.</td>', 'This is a house''s hell because a house is made for people to live in; to be filled with life.  This house is abandoned and neglected and has a barbed wired fence all around keeping everyone out. I wanted to shoot some of the other buildings on the property that were literally falling down, but didn''t know about the barbed wire until I pulled into the driveway.  If I shot them from far, a newer metal building  was in the way.  If I shot the house from the other side, it was blocked by the trees.', '2006-03-15 06:46:57.000000', NULL, 0),
