(2230421, 303320, 55170, '<td valign="top">this is very very sleek.<br/>classy.<br/>surreal, even.<br/>i think it does bring out a feeling of afterlife,<br/>because of how almost alien this looks.<br/>the colors were gd: cool and clean.<br/>i love the use of silhouette and reflection here.<br/>think that the background''s line is very gd too.<br/>it leads me to the subject.<br/> <br/>only downside is that i feel that the circle could''v been a complete one.<br/>it being cut off just like that is slightly disturbing.<br/> <br/>all in all, very nice, sleek and classy.<br/>great effort. :D</td>', 'this is very very sleek.classy.surreal, even.i think it does bring out a feeling of afterlife,because of how almost alien this looks.the colors were gd: cool and clean.i love the use of silhouette and reflection here.think that the background''s line is very gd too.it leads me to the subject. only downside is that i feel that the circle could''v been a complete one.it being cut off just like that is slightly disturbing. all in all, very nice, sleek and classy.great effort. :D', '2006-03-15 12:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
