(2230649, 304191, 53964, '<td valign="top">My first thought, too, was that the lights should be in a line, then thought, "but there can be many branching paths leading to whatever particular afterlife is waiting for you." A metaphore for our choices in life?</td>', 'My first thought, too, was that the lights should be in a line, then thought, "but there can be many branching paths leading to whatever particular afterlife is waiting for you." A metaphore for our choices in life?', '2006-03-15 13:27:30.000000', NULL, 0),
