(2230668, 302962, 32714, '<td valign="top">Thank you everybody. I came up with the idea to this shot while driving back home from Stockholm where I had planned to take a photo at the Forest Cementary (Skogskyrkogården), listed as a world herritage by UNESCO. However, I was hindered to take the photo due to heavy snowfall in Stockholm so I went back home and managed to take this photo instead before the snowfall catched up on me.</td>', 'Thank you everybody. I came up with the idea to this shot while driving back home from Stockholm where I had planned to take a photo at the Forest Cementary (Skogskyrkogården), listed as a world herritage by UNESCO. However, I was hindered to take the photo due to heavy snowfall in Stockholm so I went back home and managed to take this photo instead before the snowfall catched up on me.', '2006-03-15 13:32:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2230672, 304053, 5112, '<td valign="top">A big huge congratulations on your first ribbon here!  Well deserved, you do beautiful work.<br/> <br/></td>', 'A big huge congratulations on your first ribbon here!  Well deserved, you do beautiful work. ', '2006-03-15 13:32:43.000000', NULL, 0),
