(2230712, 303026, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your well deserved ribbon. I wasn''t sure if I wanted to check your setup because your entry image is just so fantastic. Now I''m glad I did check. What an brilliant idea - well done!</td>', 'Congrats on your well deserved ribbon. I wasn''t sure if I wanted to check your setup because your entry image is just so fantastic. Now I''m glad I did check. What an brilliant idea - well done!', '2006-03-15 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
