(2230742, 303993, 53964, '<td valign="top">My istant reaction was, "don''t like the shadows" but when I took a moment to actually think about the picture in its entirety, the title and the challenge topic I "got it". As just a pretty scenery shot, yeah, the shadows ARE distracting. For THIS shot, they''re perfect.</td>', 'My istant reaction was, "don''t like the shadows" but when I took a moment to actually think about the picture in its entirety, the title and the challenge topic I "got it". As just a pretty scenery shot, yeah, the shadows ARE distracting. For THIS shot, they''re perfect.', '2006-03-15 13:51:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2230754, 302660, 47117, '<td valign="top">Gunnsi, the footwear challenge had not been posted yet when this shot was taken. I wish it had, or I would have submitted into that instead of Education.  :)<br/> <br/>Education is a big bummer for me.  My photo is one of my most creative to date in Education, but it seems that being overly clever or creative is also a downfall.  Submission rules come into play and voters vote photos down for the "not knowing" about if it meets basic editing rules.  I find that too bad, however, I also find it quite flattering, so its really two fold. It''s a bummer cause of the scores, but it''s also flattering that the scores are low due to the "wonder" factor on a creative entry.  So I am not going to complain either way.  If one of my entries fails ribbon wise for being TOO clever, then let it! LOL...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-15 14:02:42.</i></td>', 'Gunnsi, the footwear challenge had not been posted yet when this shot was taken. I wish it had, or I would have submitted into that instead of Education.  :) Education is a big bummer for me.  My photo is one of my most creative to date in Education, but it seems that being overly clever or creative is also a downfall.  Submission rules come into play and voters vote photos down for the "not knowing" about if it meets basic editing rules.  I find that too bad, however, I also find it quite flattering, so its really two fold. It''s a bummer cause of the scores, but it''s also flattering that the scores are low due to the "wonder" factor on a creative entry.  So I am not going to complain either way.  If one of my entries fails ribbon wise for being TOO clever, then let it! LOL...', '2006-03-15 13:55:41.000000', '2006-03-15 14:02:42.000000', 0),
(2230759, 302660, 47117, '<td valign="top">Canadian_eh, the dry ice was not as hard to get as most things in my neck of the woods.  There is an ice truck and bait shop/shed that a couple run right at the top of my street. There you can get ice both regular in bags, and dry ice is made for you on the spot.  <br/> <br/>Fishing is big around here with our little stocked lakes, and the heat is also big around here. So them running both an ice truck and a bait shop is good business. :)  The fisherman can stock up on bait and keep their beers cool all at the same time.<br/> <br/>Rose</td>', 'Canadian_eh, the dry ice was not as hard to get as most things in my neck of the woods.  There is an ice truck and bait shop/shed that a couple run right at the top of my street. There you can get ice both regular in bags, and dry ice is made for you on the spot.   Fishing is big around here with our little stocked lakes, and the heat is also big around here. So them running both an ice truck and a bait shop is good business. :)  The fisherman can stock up on bait and keep their beers cool all at the same time. Rose', '2006-03-15 13:57:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2230799, 303938, 70, '<td valign="top">Wow. My measly little brain can''t comprehend how you can go from <a href="//www.frontier.net/~persianczar/DPChallenge%20Stuff/Afterlife%20Challenge%20Explanation/Stairway%20To%20Styx%20Setup%201.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> to such an awesome final shot. So cool.</td>', 'Wow. My measly little brain can''t comprehend how you can go from this to such an awesome final shot. So cool.', '2006-03-15 14:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2230825, 303938, 53964, '<td valign="top">Now that I know it''s a reflection I can see it in the lines of the flames, but that certainly doesn''t take anything away from it in either creativity or effect! I LOVE this one.</td>', 'Now that I know it''s a reflection I can see it in the lines of the flames, but that certainly doesn''t take anything away from it in either creativity or effect! I LOVE this one.', '2006-03-15 14:19:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2230897, 303953, 49652, '<td valign="top">What a powerful picture story.</td>', 'What a powerful picture story.', '2006-03-15 14:39:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2230947, 303953, 30508, '<td valign="top">Jason, I''m so sorry to hear about your tragic loss.  I''ll be hoping that your daughter continues to look over her brother.  Best wishes.</td>', 'Jason, I''m so sorry to hear about your tragic loss.  I''ll be hoping that your daughter continues to look over her brother.  Best wishes.', '2006-03-15 14:56:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231002, 304147, 40718, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot caleb, way to keep me from the green, which I have been getting a lot lately...</td>', 'Sweet shot caleb, way to keep me from the green, which I have been getting a lot lately...', '2006-03-15 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231003, 303953, 43369, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and condolences. This picture was done the day I recieved her "Death Certificate" and this was probably the first time I can actually say I shot what I was truely feeling. I did not expect it to do as well as it did considering the lighting and the bad raw conversion. <br/> <br/>This is actually my first entry and I hope my future entries to be less heavy-hearted!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and condolences. This picture was done the day I recieved her "Death Certificate" and this was probably the first time I can actually say I shot what I was truely feeling. I did not expect it to do as well as it did considering the lighting and the bad raw conversion.  This is actually my first entry and I hope my future entries to be less heavy-hearted!', '2006-03-15 15:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231023, 304139, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love the reference.  Great shot as well. 5.5? I think not...</td>', 'I love the reference.  Great shot as well. 5.5? I think not...', '2006-03-15 15:21:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231033, 304059, 40718, '<td valign="top">You continue to impress Techo. 6.3...nice.  Top bad it just missed Top 10.  I think I''ve had 4 12ths and I know the feeling...</td>', 'You continue to impress Techo. 6.3...nice.  Top bad it just missed Top 10.  I think I''ve had 4 12ths and I know the feeling...', '2006-03-15 15:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
