(2231477, 303460, 27133, '<td valign="top">To me, this is a very beautiful image.  But there is one area that I find quite distracting and out of place.  The bikini style and make.  It doesn''t fit the theme of the angel.  The light just glows off it which draws the viewers eye to there and less on the beautiful model and the theme.  Try a less prominent costume to go with the wings and I think this would be a winner.</td>', 'To me, this is a very beautiful image.  But there is one area that I find quite distracting and out of place.  The bikini style and make.  It doesn''t fit the theme of the angel.  The light just glows off it which draws the viewers eye to there and less on the beautiful model and the theme.  Try a less prominent costume to go with the wings and I think this would be a winner.', '2006-03-15 18:07:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231512, 303460, 44086, '<td valign="top">I gave it an eight in voting but was disturbed at the cropping. I think it shows much better without as much "negative" space above her head. Gorgeous model, great lighting - just out of balance a little.</td>', 'I gave it an eight in voting but was disturbed at the cropping. I think it shows much better without as much "negative" space above her head. Gorgeous model, great lighting - just out of balance a little.', '2006-03-15 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231530, 303026, 2178, '<td valign="top">Thats brilliant! Congrats.</td>', 'Thats brilliant! Congrats.', '2006-03-15 18:26:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231542, 303460, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I scored it a 10. I would have scored it around 8 because the cropping bothers me, but I gave you extra points because I knew you were gonna get slaughtered by "prude" votes.<br/> <br/>It''s hard to put any iamge of a skantly clad sexy woman into a challenge here and do well. There are those here that think the photog is using sexuality to gain higher votes. I''ll give you an example from my portfolio that recieved a HIGH number of low votes for that reason.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=262251" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/413/thumb/262251.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/413/thumb/262251.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/413/thumb/262251.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>23 1''s and 14 2''s.</td>', 'Nice image, I scored it a 10. I would have scored it around 8 because the cropping bothers me, but I gave you extra points because I knew you were gonna get slaughtered by "prude" votes. It''s hard to put any iamge of a skantly clad sexy woman into a challenge here and do well. There are those here that think the photog is using sexuality to gain higher votes. I''ll give you an example from my portfolio that recieved a HIGH number of low votes for that reason.   23 1''s and 14 2''s.', '2006-03-15 18:35:46.000000', NULL, 0),
