(2232426, 303026, 28742, '<td valign="top">Sweet!! I''ve been hitting the front page for a couple days before this thumb catches my eye and I think to myself that I hadn''t looked at this yet, so I click it and WoW! Very cool. Had I voted this challenge this would''ve set the bar - a 10. Congrats Keith!!<br/> <br/>...peeks at setup shot...<br/> <br/>Freakin brilliant! You da man! ...this week anyway. :)</td>', 'Sweet!! I''ve been hitting the front page for a couple days before this thumb catches my eye and I think to myself that I hadn''t looked at this yet, so I click it and WoW! Very cool. Had I voted this challenge this would''ve set the bar - a 10. Congrats Keith!! ...peeks at setup shot... Freakin brilliant! You da man! ...this week anyway. :)', '2006-03-16 01:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2232478, 304053, 1717, '<td valign="top">w00t!  congrats, hon...this is a gorgeous shot!  ''bout damn time you got a ribbon! *hug*</td>', 'w00t!  congrats, hon...this is a gorgeous shot!  ''bout damn time you got a ribbon! *hug*', '2006-03-16 02:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2232479, 304108, 53668, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue ribbon (but on the other end of the scale)<br/>This is an excellent depiction of many peoples view on the afterlife.<br/>Its a good thing you had a 6 megapixel camera to capture it.<br/>My own view is much the same but perhaps a bit more like the ''noise'' on a TV set, a sort of electrons and protons regrouping.<br/>However if they are handing out those cool wings and I can run around lookin like a born again virgin, boy-o-boy, I am sure goin with that.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work,  Kansas!</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue ribbon (but on the other end of the scale)This is an excellent depiction of many peoples view on the afterlife.Its a good thing you had a 6 megapixel camera to capture it.My own view is much the same but perhaps a bit more like the ''noise'' on a TV set, a sort of electrons and protons regrouping.However if they are handing out those cool wings and I can run around lookin like a born again virgin, boy-o-boy, I am sure goin with that. Keep up the good work,  Kansas!', '2006-03-16 02:15:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2232890, 303756, 44611, '<td valign="top">Well, I screwed up.  This wasn''t an ''existing'' artwork of any kind before shooting, being a combination of a silhouette and a background, put together purely for the shot.  But -- apparently that counts as a collage and as there is no 3-D element added, as in Rose8699''s The 80s, ET challenge entry, this makes it a literal interpretation.<br/> <br/>Lesson learned - onward and upward - hopefully.</td>', 'Well, I screwed up.  This wasn''t an ''existing'' artwork of any kind before shooting, being a combination of a silhouette and a background, put together purely for the shot.  But -- apparently that counts as a collage and as there is no 3-D element added, as in Rose8699''s The 80s, ET challenge entry, this makes it a literal interpretation. Lesson learned - onward and upward - hopefully.', '2006-03-16 07:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
