(2234424, 303767, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract look to this.  It feels soft and fluffy, which seems like a believable place a soul would float to me.  I think the colors are great, but I do wish they were actually a bit more vibrant, I don''t mind the soft almost pastel-like hue of them, but it seems as though there is a slight dulling of the color for some reason.  I''ve no idea what went into creating the image so I couldn''t say if it was because of not enough light or what.. but if there was just a bit more punch I''d like this even better.   I didn''t vote on this challenge or anything but I think this did far worse than it should''ve.  I think its a great representation of the theme you chose and of the challenge.</td>', 'I love the abstract look to this.  It feels soft and fluffy, which seems like a believable place a soul would float to me.  I think the colors are great, but I do wish they were actually a bit more vibrant, I don''t mind the soft almost pastel-like hue of them, but it seems as though there is a slight dulling of the color for some reason.  I''ve no idea what went into creating the image so I couldn''t say if it was because of not enough light or what.. but if there was just a bit more punch I''d like this even better.   I didn''t vote on this challenge or anything but I think this did far worse than it should''ve.  I think its a great representation of the theme you chose and of the challenge.', '2006-03-16 19:45:27.000000', NULL, 0),
