(2236911, 303767, 53316, '<td valign="top">Cyndane:<br/>It''s actually cotton. The blue came from me holding a transparent blue plastic object between the cotton and the light, and the red came when I held my finger over the flash (while pressing the shutter with my, um, third hand?).<br/> <br/>LucidLotus:<br/>Thanks for the kind words. I had a feeling that it wasn''t going to be like most submissions due to the abstractness.  I''m happy with the photo, and it''s nice to see that some do not mind it being abstract!<br/> <br/>moniepenny:<br/>I agree that the not having anything to focus on can be a problem, and I''m going to address that more in the future.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments, you three, as well as everyone else.  Greatly appreciated!</td>', 'Cyndane:It''s actually cotton. The blue came from me holding a transparent blue plastic object between the cotton and the light, and the red came when I held my finger over the flash (while pressing the shutter with my, um, third hand?). LucidLotus:Thanks for the kind words. I had a feeling that it wasn''t going to be like most submissions due to the abstractness.  I''m happy with the photo, and it''s nice to see that some do not mind it being abstract! moniepenny:I agree that the not having anything to focus on can be a problem, and I''m going to address that more in the future. Thanks for the comments, you three, as well as everyone else.  Greatly appreciated!', '2006-03-18 00:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
