(2237390, 302043, 15711, '<td valign="top">I swore I commented on this. Had given it a 9. Love the off center and the white negative space.  I like the artistic interpretation of the petals. Filter?</td>', 'I swore I commented on this. Had given it a 9. Love the off center and the white negative space.  I like the artistic interpretation of the petals. Filter?', '2006-03-18 11:34:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2237533, 304147, 5885, '<td valign="top">Celeb, after seeing the reason you were DQ''d, I stopped to think about this a while. <br/> <br/>The same effect you achieved with the second sharpened layer could have been achieved with the Fade command in the Edit menu.<br/> <br/>Right after you apply the USM, go to edit and select Fade USM and then adjust transparency of the USM. Hope that helps.</td>', 'Celeb, after seeing the reason you were DQ''d, I stopped to think about this a while.  The same effect you achieved with the second sharpened layer could have been achieved with the Fade command in the Edit menu. Right after you apply the USM, go to edit and select Fade USM and then adjust transparency of the USM. Hope that helps.', '2006-03-18 13:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
