(2244170, 303026, 38032, '<td valign="top">Your style is difinitive of why this web site is a success.  Original yet simple ... your use of "ordinary desk lamps" with conventional things people might find around the house is inspiring.<br/>In an era where people tend to think that photoshop can do anything and everything (a false idea of course) ... One has a reality check when seeing clean, barely altered images right off the camera.<br/></td>', 'Your style is difinitive of why this web site is a success.  Original yet simple ... your use of "ordinary desk lamps" with conventional things people might find around the house is inspiring.In an era where people tend to think that photoshop can do anything and everything (a false idea of course) ... One has a reality check when seeing clean, barely altered images right off the camera.', '2006-03-21 11:43:55.000000', NULL, 0),
