(2249996, 302371, 28710, '<td valign="top">Hey guy, what''s a heaven''s gate cloud?<br/> <br/>What I do like about this is the tone. There are some great tones in the dead trees and the moody sky, but I''m having trouble with the lack of actual subject here. None of the clouds stand out to me.<br/> <br/>Also your message is a little unclear to me. I am thinking about the fact that we are 70% water... ?<br/> <br/>Kinda tough to figure.<br/> <br/>Keep going though. There''s promise here yet!</td>', 'Hey guy, what''s a heaven''s gate cloud? What I do like about this is the tone. There are some great tones in the dead trees and the moody sky, but I''m having trouble with the lack of actual subject here. None of the clouds stand out to me. Also your message is a little unclear to me. I am thinking about the fact that we are 70% water... ? Kinda tough to figure. Keep going though. There''s promise here yet!', '2006-03-23 01:01:22.000000', NULL, 0),
