(2254170, 303953, 44751, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t bring myself to vote on this image.  Its too emotive to make a flippant gesture of voting.  However, it effected me and I was keen to return to the image and read the notes following votes closing.  <br/> <br/>I am a nurse who has worked in operating theatres for years and seen many a premature baby delivered.  I have frequently been truly astounded by the amazing stories of survival these incredible little people achieve.  Keep that in mind while your little boy grows stronger and has bad days, too.<br/> <br/>Nicole.</td>', 'I couldn''t bring myself to vote on this image.  Its too emotive to make a flippant gesture of voting.  However, it effected me and I was keen to return to the image and read the notes following votes closing.   I am a nurse who has worked in operating theatres for years and seen many a premature baby delivered.  I have frequently been truly astounded by the amazing stories of survival these incredible little people achieve.  Keep that in mind while your little boy grows stronger and has bad days, too. Nicole.', '2006-03-24 06:47:32.000000', NULL, 0),
