(2407033, 304003, 42013, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest, this was not one of my favorite pictures from this challenge. Ive tried to figure it out b/c i really like sea and waterscapes so these feelings are a departure from the norm for me.<br/> <br/>With a second examination of your pic, i guess my lack of attraction to this scene is the dominating foreground with its wild texture and color. This is not a very soothing photo like many seascapes. But then, it does fit your title well. I did give it a 6 during voting so i didn''t totally slam it, it''s just that normally a photo like this would garner a 7 or higher from me.<br/> <br/>Just my .02 and honestly the picture is growing on me a little as i sit and ponder.</td>', 'I''ll be honest, this was not one of my favorite pictures from this challenge. Ive tried to figure it out b/c i really like sea and waterscapes so these feelings are a departure from the norm for me. With a second examination of your pic, i guess my lack of attraction to this scene is the dominating foreground with its wild texture and color. This is not a very soothing photo like many seascapes. But then, it does fit your title well. I did give it a 6 during voting so i didn''t totally slam it, it''s just that normally a photo like this would garner a 7 or higher from me. Just my .02 and honestly the picture is growing on me a little as i sit and ponder.', '2006-05-11 19:30:52.000000', NULL, 0),
